Changelog: 17-10-2026 10:10:41

Release 0.2.0.

Changelog: 17-10-2026 10:05:20

Fixed. The app's folder in the suite is apps/bios (was apps/bios-reader) and its package is bios_reader (was
bc250_bios_reader): the suite's naming convention (owner, 17-10-2026), a short folder name and the package named
after the app without the BC-250 prefix. With the folder go its key in the portal, its chapter of the wiki
(apps/bios/), its installer test and its release tags: bios-v<x.y.z> from the next release on, which is also what
the app's update check looks for. The installed app keeps its name, its launcher bc250-bios-reader, its folder
under ~/.local/share, its settings and its dumps; the portal moves its record of the installed copy to the new key.

